PROPOSED FIXES
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

[FIX-1] §6.2 加固后的规则编译器
  status: VERIFIED
  hostile column name    -> RuleError: 非法列名: 'NetWorth` OR 1=1 -- '
  unknown column         -> RuleError: 列不存在于特征表: not_a_column
  empty conditions       -> RuleError: conditions 不能为空
  empty IN list          -> RuleError: IN 的 value 必须是非空列表

  nested group without 'logic' -> (`aum` >= :v_0 OR (`product_a_holding` > :v_1 AND `city` IN :v_2))
    params={'v_0': 1000000, 'v_1': 0, 'v_2': ['北京', '上海']} expanding=['v_2']
    rule columns for leakage exclusion -> ['aum', 'city', 'product_a_holding']

  executed with expanding bindparams -> 1 row(s) matched

[FIX-2] §6.1 修订后的结果表 DDL 与窗口函数写入路径
  status: VERIFIED
  CREATE TABLE (RANGE COLUMNS on batch_date, PK = idempotency key) -> exit=0 
  REORGANIZE p_max to append next month (the F-07 fix) -> exit=0 
  rank + percentile computed in-database (the F-17 fix) -> exit=0 
  retry writes the same rows again (the F-09 fix)      -> exit=0 
  DROP PARTITION for retention (the F-07 fix)          -> exit=0 

  rows after running the batch twice: 3 (3 staged rows, no duplicates)

